evidence = "The closure evidence produced by the done task at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:350661 must replace open_with_network in spec/layerx-merge/dispositions/d11-6.kvx:124 with PaymentGate::new_with_network_id, declared at services/interop/crates/x-websearch/src/payment.rs:1190 with network_id: u32 at line 1192, while preserving the resolved status because PaymentGate::new rejects an unresolved network ID at line 1183 and services/interop/crates/x-websearch/src/main.rs:443 passes the startup-resolved ID to that constructor."
close_comment = "The closure evidence for finding 11.31.2.a2 should name PaymentGate::new_with_network_id instead of open_with_network. The resolved status remains valid: the constructor accepts the resolved network ID as u32, and PaymentGate::new rejects an unresolved configured value."
